.SS "\fBCompareResult\fP SystemEx\&.Numeric\&.Half16b\&.CompareTo (\fBHalf16b\fP b)"

.PP
Compares this instance with another \fBHalf16\fP and returns a \fBCompareResult\fP describing the relationship\&. NaN is treated as unordered: if this instance is NaN and the other is not, the result is \fBCompareResult\&.AIsSmallerB\fP to provide a deterministic ordering for sorting and data structures\&. 

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIb\fP The value to compare with this instance\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
A \fBCompareResult\fP indicating whether this instance is smaller than, equal to, or larger than \fIb\fP \&. 
.RE
.PP

