.SS "int IComparable< \fBHalf16b\fP >\&. SystemEx\&.Numeric\&.Half16b\&.CompareTo (\fBHalf16b\fP other)"

.PP
Explicit IComparable<T> implementation that forwards to the extended \fBCompareTo(Half16b)\fP method and casts the \fBCompareResult\fP to int\&. This keeps the standard \&.NET comparison API compatible while still exposing a strongly typed comparison result via \fBIComparableEx<Half16b>\fP\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIother\fP The value to compare with\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
A signed integer indicating the relative order\&. 
.RE
.PP

