.SS "int SystemEx\&.Numeric\&.Half16b\&.CompareTo (object? obj)"

.PP
Compares this instance with another object and returns an integer indicating the relative order, following the standard IComparable contract\&. If \fIobj\fP  is a \fBHalf16b\fP, the comparison is delegated to \fBCompareTo(Half16b)\fP and the resulting \fBCompareResult\fP is cast to int\&. 

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIobj\fP The object to compare with\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
A signed integer indicating the relative order: negative if this instance is smaller, zero if equal, positive if larger\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBExceptions\fP
.RS 4
\fIArgumentException\fP Thrown if \fIobj\fP  is not a \fBHalf16\fP\&. 
.RE
.PP

